      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Creating Custom Exception\n========================\n\nCustom Exception are those classes created by proggrammer for handling specific exception in their project .\n\nHow to make custom exception\n\n1. Create a class and make it child of Some Exception class generally we use Exception class .\n\n2. Make a paramaterized constructor in class which accepts String and this String to parent class constructor . ",
