      "text": "Multi catch\n==========\n\nWhen we two or more catch has same body we can merge them into single catch known as milti catch.\n\nSyntax\n--------\n\ntry{\n}\ncatch(ExceptionClass1 | ExceptionClass2  ....  ref){\n    ..............\n    ............\n}\n",
